<title>CANADA: Paperboard Industries Q3 shr net drops.</title>
<headline>Paperboard Industries Q3 shr net drops.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.11		   C$0.26</p>
<p> Net			  5,548		   10,410</p>
<p> Revs		     209,640		  680,509</p>
<p>	    9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.39		   C$0.66</p>
<p> Net			 19,692		   30,834</p>
<p> Revs		     680,509		  770,421</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: Full name is Paperboard Industries International Inc. Net earnings for the nine months ended September 30, 1996 included non-recurring gains after income taxes of C$5,251,000 recorded in the second quarter and a loss of C$380,000 recorded in the third quarter.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau  (416) 941-8100</p>
